WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The refrigeration cycle is the foundation of everything you'll do in this trade.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Quiz testing refrigeration cycle stages, PT chart usage, superheat and
subcooling calculations, compressor diagnosis, metering device operation, and
gauge reading interpretation.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Refrigeration knowledge is core to EPA 608
and every job interview.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Calculate superheat and subcooling from given readings. And
— Know what high/low values indicate

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Before you move on — what happens to refrigerant in the evaporator? Don't look
it up. Think about it.

